\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/MockRevenueCatPaywallService\/customerInfoStream()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" yields it first. Streams"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fan out — each call returns an independent stream, and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/MockRevenueCatPaywallService\/send(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" delivers to every stream"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"that is still open — so two stores sharing one mock, or a "},{"code":"ResilientPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" wrapper"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"plus the paywall plugin, all observe the same transitions. ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/MockRevenueCatPaywallService\/finish()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ends the streams that","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are open at the time. Set "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/MockRevenueCatPaywallService\/customerInfoError","isActive":true},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/MockRevenueCatPaywallService\/restoreError","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" to make the corresponding","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"call throw, e.g. to drive the plugin’s ","type":"text"},{"code":".refreshFailed","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" path or a ","type":"text"},{"code":"ResilientPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"fallback."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Deliberate differences from the real ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevenueCatPaywallService"},{"text":", chosen so tests are","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deterministic:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A stream buffers every value it has not delivered yet; the real stream keeps only the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"newest. A test that sends several snapshots before its consumer runs sees each one, in order.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A new stream always yields the current snapshot first; the real stream yields a first value"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"only if RevenueCat has already delivered customer info in this process.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Compared with Swidux’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"SimulatedPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (an actor with a dev-paywall UI and simulated","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"latency, better suited to vendor-free previews and development builds), this mock offers a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"synchronous ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/MockRevenueCatPaywallService\/send(_:)"},{"text":", arbitrary injected errors, ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/MockRevenueCatPaywallService\/finish()"},{"text":", and delivery of repeated","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identical snapshots — ","type":"text"},{"code":"SimulatedPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" drops a change that equals the current state."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"MockPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in SwiduxPaywall differs again: its stream finishes immediately after the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"initial yield, so it